4 (viii) near a bus stop, school or hospital entrance or blocking a traffic sign or entrance to a premises or a fire hydrant;
(ix) on the wrong side of the road;
(x) where parking is prohibited;
(xi) away from the edge of the footpath.
14. Parking of the lorry on the middle of the road itself is not permissible and the accident has occurred due to the parking of the lorry on the national highway without any precautions or any indications.
